    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. i guess those are the main things people point to. but what about the other side of things? i've heard some people say that things like deregulation and lower taxes actually help the economy grow in the long run and that inequality is just a side effect of a productive system. do you think those arguments hold weight too?",
